  "dct_title_s": "Glen V. Mills' directory maps of Ann Arbor, Ypsilanti, and Washtenaw county 1894.",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Glen V. Mills published a directories for towns and cities across Michigan in the 1890s and early 1900s. Presumably these maps would serve as an accompaniment to the directories.; Includes full page maps of Ann Arbor, Ypsilanti, and Washtenaw county. Smaller maps of surrounding cities are included on the last page of the atlas.; The maps of the cities include streets names and railroad lines. The Washtenaw county map shows plats and city and town boundaries.",
    "1 atlas (4 pages) 36 x 32 cm"
